--- !u!114 &8670411874848046228
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2756067959945242663}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3813d233fadc3c6458bee87ff3ad93af, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText: {fileID: 3328475992782558491}
  lines:
  - "Hedefin bu mekanda!  Orta ya\u015Flarda, gri sa\xE7l\u0131, beyaz ti\u015F\xF6rt,
    siyah ceket..."
  - "Liderin en g\xFCvendi\u011Fi adamlardan biri. Onun zihnine girebilmemiz i\xE7in
    \xF6nce yerini netle\u015Ftirmen gerekiyor."
  - "Do\u011Frudan ba\u011Flant\u0131 kuramazs\u0131n. \xD6nce stres seviyesini y\xFCkseltmelisin."
  - "Mekanda k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir aksakl\u0131k yarat\u0131p hedefi savunmas\u0131z
    b\u0131rakmal\u0131s\u0131n."
  - "Dikkatli ol! Hedefine fark edilmemelisin. Hedef mekandan ayr\u0131lmadan zihnindeki
    bilgilere ula\u015Fmal\u0131s\u0131n."
  textSpeed: 0.05
  lineDelay: 1
